    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46112" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζαφλεγής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>, 
			Ep.
		
		Adj.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>full of fire</i>, of men at
			their prime, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλλοτε μέν τε ζαφλεγέες τελέθουσιν . .
					ἄλλοτε δὲ Φθινύθουσιν ἀκήριοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					21.465
				</span></i>
			; of <i>fiery</i> horses, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Hom.</u>
				8.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>shining, bright</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄστρα</span>
			Orac. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Eus.
				<u>PE</u>
				3.15
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σέλας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					2.26
				</span></i>
			.</div>
